title: Inter-bloc Relations
subtitle: Build bridges with another bloc.
is-card: true
tags: caucus_affairs
card-image: img/card_relations.svg
view-if: relations_timer <= 0
on-arrival: turn_actions += 1; relations_timer = 3; last_card_timer = "relations"
new-page: true

= Inter-bloc Relations

No bloc in the Senate can govern alone. Which relationship should the Caucus invest in? Each costs 1 political capital.

- @mod: The Core Moderates.
- @ind: The Independents.
- @rim: The Rimward Coalition.
- @sec: The Security Bloc.
- @guild: The Commerce Guilds.
- @pal: The Chancellor's allies.
- @cis: The Separatist Caucus.
- @rfc: The breakaway party.
- @word: A friendly word in the corridors.
- @easy_discard

@mod
subtitle: +8 relations with the Core Moderates. Currently [+ mod_relation : relationships +].
choose-if: capital >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough political capital.
on-arrival: capital -= 1; mod_relation += 8; inst_dissent -= 2

@ind
subtitle: +8 relations with the Independents. Currently [+ ind_relation : relationships +].
choose-if: capital >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough political capital.
on-arrival: capital -= 1; ind_relation += 8

@rim
view-if: parties_has_rim
subtitle: +8 relations with the Rimward Coalition. Currently [+ rim_relation : relationships +].
choose-if: capital >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough political capital.
on-arrival: capital -= 1; rim_relation += 8; rimward_dissent -= 2; inst_dissent += 1

@sec
subtitle: +8 relations with the Security Bloc. Currently [+ sec_relation : relationships +]. The Pacifists disapprove.
choose-if: capital >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough political capital.
on-arrival: capital -= 1; sec_relation += 8; hawk_dissent -= 2; pacifist_dissent += 3

@guild
subtitle: +8 relations with the Commerce Guilds. Currently [+ guild_relation : relationships +]. The Rimward wing disapproves.
choose-if: capital >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough political capital.
on-arrival: capital -= 1; guild_relation += 8; rimward_dissent += 5

@pal
subtitle: +8 relations with the [+ pal_name +]. Currently [+ pal_relation : relationships +].[? if evidence >= 4 : The Caucus is deeply uneasy about this. ?]
choose-if: capital >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough political capital.
on-arrival: capital -= 1; pal_relation += 8; inst_dissent += 4 if evidence >= 4; pacifist_dissent += 4 if evidence >= 4

@cis
view-if: cis_formed and parties_has_cis
subtitle: +8 relations with the Separatist Caucus. Currently [+ cis_relation : relationships +]. The Hawks will be outraged.
choose-if: capital >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough political capital.
on-arrival: capital -= 1; cis_relation += 8; hawk_dissent += 6; pacifist_dissent -= 3

@rfc
view-if: rfc_formed
subtitle: +8 relations with the [+ rfc_name +]. Currently [+ rfc_relation : relationships +].
choose-if: capital >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough political capital.
on-arrival: capital -= 1; rfc_relation += 8

@word
subtitle: Free. +1 relations with the Core Moderates and the Independents.
on-arrival: mod_relation += 1; ind_relation += 1

A few kind words and a shared drink cost nothing, and are worth a little.
